@@ -0,0 +1,212 @@
+Feature: TodoMVC
+  As a user
+  I want to manage a todo list
+  So that I can track tasks I need to complete
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Rule: No-todos state
+
+  Scenario: Main and footer are hidden when there are no todos
+    Given there are no todos
+    Then the ".main" section is hidden
+    And the ".footer" section is hidden
+
+  Rule: Creating todos
+
+  Scenario: Create a new todo by pressing Enter
+    When I type "Buy milk" into the new-todo input and press Enter
+    Then I see 1 todo in the list
+    And the new-todo input is cleared
+    And the todo text is "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Trimming whitespace from new todo
+    When I type "   Buy milk   " into the new-todo input and press Enter
+    Then I see 1 todo in the list
+    And the todo text is "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Empty todo is ignored
+    When I type "   " into the new-todo input and press Enter
+    Then I see 0 todos in the list
+
+  Rule: Completing todos
+
+  Scenario: Mark a todo as completed
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I click the toggle checkbox for "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" has class "completed"
+    And the toggle checkbox for "Buy milk" is checked
+
+  Scenario: Unmark a completed todo
+    Given I have a completed todo "Buy milk"
+    When I click the toggle checkbox for "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" does not have class "completed"
+    And the toggle checkbox for "Buy milk" is not checked
+
+  Rule: Toggle all
+
+  Scenario: Mark all todos as complete
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk", "Buy eggs", "Buy bread"
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then all shown todos are completed
+
+  Scenario: Toggle all reflects individual completion state
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk", "Buy eggs", "Buy bread"
+    When I complete the todo "Buy milk"
+    And I complete the todo "Buy eggs"
+    And I complete the todo "Buy bread"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle all unchecks when a todo is unchecked
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk", "Buy eggs", "Buy bread"
+    And all existing todos are completed
+    When I uncomplete the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is not checked
+
+  Rule: Editing todos
+
+  Scenario: Double-click a label to enter editing mode
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I double-click the label for "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" has class "editing"
+    And the edit input for "Buy milk" is focused
+
+  Scenario: Save edit on Enter
+    Given I am editing the todo "Buy milk"
+    When I change the text to "Buy organic milk" and press Enter
+    Then the todo text is "Buy organic milk"
+    And the todo "Buy organic milk" does not have class "editing"
+
+  Scenario: Save edit on blur
+    Given I am editing the todo "Buy milk"
+    When I change the text to "Buy organic milk" and blur
+    Then the todo text is "Buy organic milk"
+    And the todo "Buy organic milk" does not have class "editing"
+
+  Scenario: Discard edit on Escape
+    Given I am editing the todo "Buy milk"
+    When I change the text to "Buy organic milk" and press Escape
+    Then the todo text is "Buy milk"
+    And the todo "Buy milk" does not have class "editing"
+
+  Scenario: Empty edit destroys the todo
+    Given I am editing the todo "Buy milk"
+    When I clear the text and press Enter
+    Then I see 0 todos in the list
+
+  Scenario: Whitespace-only edit destroys the todo
+    Given I am editing the todo "Buy milk"
+    When I change the text to "   " and press Enter
+    Then I see 0 todos in the list
+
+  Rule: Deleting todos
+
+  Scenario: Delete a todo
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I click the destroy button for "Buy milk"
+    Then I see 0 todos in the list
+
+  Rule: Item counter
+
+  Scenario: Show correct count of active items
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk", "Buy eggs", "Buy bread"
+    When I complete the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo-count shows "2 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Singular "item" for one active todo
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo-count shows "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Zero items uses plural
+    Given there are no todos
+    Then the todo-count shows "0 items left"
+
+  Rule: Clear completed
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes completed todos
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk", "Buy eggs", "Buy bread"
+    And I complete the todo "Buy milk"
+    When I click "Clear completed"
+    Then I see 2 todos in the list
+    And the todo "Buy milk" is not in the list
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed is hidden when no todos are completed
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk", "Buy eggs"
+    Then the clear-completed button is hidden
+
+  Rule: Routing and filtering
+
+  Scenario: Default route shows all todos
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk", "Buy eggs", "Buy bread"
+    And I complete the todo "Buy milk"
+    When I navigate to "#/"
+    Then I see 3 todos in the list
+
+  Scenario: Active filter shows only active todos
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk", "Buy eggs", "Buy bread"
+    And I complete the todo "Buy milk"
+    When I navigate to "#/active"
+    Then I see 2 todos in the list
+    And the "Active" filter link has class "selected"
+
+  Scenario: Completed filter shows only completed todos
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk", "Buy eggs", "Buy bread"
+    And I complete the todo "Buy milk"
+    When I navigate to "#/completed"
+    Then I see 1 todo in the list
+    And the "Completed" filter link has class "selected"
+
+  Scenario: Completing a todo in active filter hides it
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk", "Buy eggs"
+    When I navigate to "#/active"
+    When I complete the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then I see 1 todo in the list
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all completes all, filter preserves visibility
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk", "Buy eggs"
+    When I navigate to "#/active"
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then I see 0 todos in the list
+    And the "Active" filter link has class "selected"
+
+  Rule: Persistence
+
+  Scenario: Todos persist across reload
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I reload the app
+    Then I see 1 todo in the list
+    And the todo text is "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Completed state persists across reload
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    And I complete the todo "Buy milk"
+    When I reload the app
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" has class "completed"
+
+  Scenario: Active filter persists across reload
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk", "Buy eggs", "Buy bread"
+    And I complete the todo "Buy milk"
+    When I navigate to "#/active"
+    When I reload the app
+    Then I see 2 todos in the list
+    And the "Active" filter link has class "selected"
+
+  Rule: Autofocus
+
+  Scenario: New-todo input is focused on page load
+    Then the new-todo input has focus
+
+  Rule: Toggle-all checkbox sync
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all syncs when all todos manually completed
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk", "Buy eggs"
+    When I complete the todo "Buy milk"
+    And I complete the todo "Buy eggs"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all unchecks when one todo unchecked
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    And all existing todos are completed
+    When I uncomplete the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is not checked
